<title>USA: NEC Computer cuts Versa notebook prices.</title>
<headline>NEC Computer cuts Versa notebook prices.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>NEC Computer said on Thursday it was cutting prices of its Versa notebook computers by up to 17 percent.</p>
<p>New estimated selling prices are $3,499 for the NEC Versa 6000H, down from $3,999 previously; and $3,799 for the NEC Versa 6010H, down from $4,599.</p>
</text>
